1746335178\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Cyberpunk Environment</h2>Immerse yourself in the heart of an oppressive cyberpunk city.<br>- Various apartments, corridors, and areas to explore<br>- A sound and visual atmosphere that complements the plot<br>- A world filled with dangers<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2946600/extras/330d9dcdba121531814ee14b4d553286.poster.avif?t=1746335178\" width=608 height=296 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2946600/extras/330d9dcdba121531814ee14b4d553286.webm?t=1746335178\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2946600/extras/330d9dcdba121531814ee14b4d553286.mp4?t=1746335178\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
